  "label": "Xenophobia",
  "description": "The meme promotes xenophobia by suggesting a preference for one group of immigrants (Swedish women) over another (Muslims) based on nationality and perceived cultural compatibility. This is a form of prejudice against people from other countries, often rooted in fear of cultural or religious difference. The meme uses the visual of attractive, Western women to imply that they are superior to other groups, reinforcing a hierarchy of worth based on superficial criteria.",
